### Happy path — seeded order id = 1, every product type covered
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/processOrder
Content-Type: application/json

### Order not found -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/999/processOrder
Content-Type: application/json

### Negative id -> 400 (path variable validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/-1/processOrder
Content-Type: application/json

### Non-numeric id -> 400 (type mismatch)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/abc/processOrder
Content-Type: application/json

### Wrong HTTP method -> 405
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/1/processOrder

### Product availability — NORMAL in stock (id=1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1/availability

### Product availability — NORMAL out of stock (id=2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/2/availability

### Product availability — EXPIRABLE in date (id=3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/3/availability

### Product availability — EXPIRABLE expired (id=4)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/4/availability

### Product availability — SEASONAL in season (id=5)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/5/availability

### Product availability — SEASONAL out of season (id=6)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/6/availability

### Product not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/999/availability
